<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SYNERGY-SSCBS | Vincenza 7.0</title>
    <%- include('partials/head') %>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            --brand: #44ccff;
            --bg: #0A0A0A;
            --panel: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
            --text: #ffffff;
            --muted: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
            --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
            background: radial-gradient(1200px 800px at 20% 10%, rgba(68, 204, 255, 0.18), transparent 55%),
                linear-gradient(135deg, #060606 0%, #141414 100%);
            color: var(--text);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 1.25rem;
        }

        .hero {
            min-height: 88vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            padding: 64px 0;
        }

        .hero-bg {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: url('/images/Vincenza/vincenza.jpg') center/cover no-repeat;
            filter: saturate(1.05) contrast(1.05) brightness(0.8);
            transform: scale(1.06);
            z-index: -2;
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45) 60%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75) 100%);
            z-index: -1;
        }

        .hero-card {
            text-align: center;
            padding: clamp(18px, 3.5vw, 28px);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 22px;
            background: var(--panel);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            box-shadow: 0 18px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border: 1px solid rgba(68, 204, 255, 0.35);
            background: rgba(68, 204, 255, 0.14);
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            color: rgba(68, 204, 255, 0.95);
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 0.16em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
            line-height: 1.05;
            font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4.2rem);
            text-shadow: 0 0 26px rgba(68, 204, 255, 0.22);
        }

        .hero-description {
            margin: 16px auto 0;
            max-width: 70ch;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.7vw, 1.12rem);
            line-height: 1.75;
        }

        .actions {
            margin-top: 22px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 12px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
            transition: transform 160ms ease, background 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease, box-shadow 160ms ease;
            user-select: none;
        }

        .btn:hover,
        .btn:focus-visible {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            outline: none;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            color: #00110a;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(68, 204, 255, 0.98) 0%, rgba(20, 255, 210, 0.86) 100%);
            border-color: rgba(68, 204, 255, 0.55);
            box-shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(68, 204, 255, 0.18);
        }

        .btn-ghost {
            color: var(--text);
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
        }

        .section {
            padding: 54px 0;
        }

        .section h2 {
            font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.4vw, 2.3rem);
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .section p {
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.8;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }

        .info-grid {
            margin-top: 20px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .info {
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 16px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .info .k {
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: rgba(68, 204, 255, 0.95);
        }

        .info .v {
            margin-top: 8px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .partner-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .partner-text{
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .partner-logo {
            height: 60px;
            width: auto;
            max-width: 240px;
            object-fit: contain;
            background: transparent;
            padding: 0;
            border-radius: 0;
            border: 0;
            box-shadow: none;
        }

        .feature-grid {
            margin-top: 22px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .feature-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 18px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .feature-top {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .feature-icon {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border: 1px solid rgba(68, 204, 255, 0.35);
            background: rgba(68, 204, 255, 0.12);
            color: rgba(68, 204, 255, 0.95);
            flex: 0 0 auto;
        }

        .feature-title {
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.01em;
        }

        .feature-subtitle {
            margin-top: 2px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.74);
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .quote {
            margin-top: 16px;
            padding: 18px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(68, 204, 255, 0.28);
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
            box-shadow: 0 14px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
        }

        .quote p {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.9;
        }

        @media (max-width: 820px) {
            .info-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .feature-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

    <section class="hero" aria-label="Vincenza 7.0 hero section">
        <div class="hero-bg"></div>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="hero-card">
                <div class="badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i> Case Submission Round: Ongoing</div>
                <p class="hero-subtitle">The Flagship Corporate Conclave of SSCBS</p>
                <h1 class="hero-title">EY x Vincenza 7.0</h1>
                <p class="hero-description">
                    Synergy - The Corporate Society of SSCBS proudly presents EY x Vincenza 7.0, the annual flagship event of
                    Shaheed Sukhdev College of Business Studies, University of Delhi, in association with Ernst & Young (EY),
                    Powered By Unstop and supported by Associate Sponsors - RedBus, TIMES Institute, Mad Over Donuts and Gem Mines.
                    Case Partner - Crowwd. Hosted on Unstop and also listed on StartupNews.fyi.
                    This year, Vincenza 7.0 returns bigger and better than ever, with EY as the Title Partner. Winners will receive
                    an exclusive Pre-Internship Interview Opportunity at EY and Crowwd, along with a Prize Pool of ₹1,00,000+ in Cash & Kind.
                </p>
                <div class="actions">
                    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://unstop.com/college-fests/vincenza-70-x-ey-shaheed-sukhdev-college-of-business-studies-university-of-delhi-440293" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                        Unstop <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i>
                    </a>
                    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://startupnews.fyi/startup-events/vicenza-7-0-x-ey-new-delhi-19th-march-2026/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                        View on StartupNews <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i>
                    </a>
                    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/events#vincenza-7-0">
                        Back to Events <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                    </a>
                    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/contact">
                        Contact Us <i class="fa-regular fa-envelope"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-label="About Vincenza 7.0">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Vincenza 7.0</h2>
            <p>
                Vincenza is not merely a competition - it is a simulated corporate battleground where strategy, precision, and
                execution define distinction. Designed to mirror real-world boardroom dynamics, it challenges participants to think
                critically, act decisively, and defend their ideas with conviction.
            </p>

            <div class="info-grid">
                <div class="info">
                    <div class="k">Status</div>
                    <div class="v">Case Submission Round • Ongoing (submit via Unstop)</div>
                </div>
                <div class="info">
                    <div class="k">Title Partner</div>
                    <div class="v partner-row">
                        <img class="partner-logo" src="/images/Vincenza/EY-Logo-Transparent.png" alt="EY logo">
                        <span class="partner-text">Ernst & Young</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="info">
                    <div class="k">Case Partner</div>
                    <div class="v partner-row">
                        <img class="partner-logo" src="/images/Vincenza/crowwd.jpg-removebg.png" alt="Crowwd logo">
                        <!-- <span>Crowwd</span> -->
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="info">
                    <div class="k">Prize Pool</div>
                    <div class="v">₹1,00,000+ (Cash & Kind)</div>
                </div>
                <div class="info">
                    <div class="k">Opportunity</div>
                    <div class="v">Pre-Internship Interview Opportunity at EY and Crowwd</div>
                </div>
                <div class="info">
                    <div class="k">Powered By</div>
                    <div class="v">Unstop</div>
                </div>
                <div class="info">
                    <div class="k">Associate Sponsors</div>
                    <div class="v">RedBus • TIMES Institute • Mad Over Donuts • Gem Mines • Fresca • Uniliv</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="quote" aria-label="Vincenza 7.0 statement">
                <p>Participants begin as contenders. They leave as strategists.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-label="Competitions at Vincenza 7.0">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Competitions</h2>
            <p>
                From consulting frameworks and market expansion to product positioning and execution strategy, structured reasoning
                is paramount at every stage.
            </p>

            <div class="feature-grid">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-top">
                        <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-chess-knight"></i></div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="feature-title">Corporate Clash</div>
                            <div class="feature-subtitle">Strategy In The Shadows</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p>
                        Vincenza’s premier consulting and strategy competition that places participants in the middle of a 
                        high-stakes FMCG crisis. Teams step in as EY analysts to investigate OakRidge Foods’ sudden market 
                        collapse, analyze operational failures, and recommend a strategic path forward whether through an 
                        independent turnaround or a high-stakes acquisition. From brand recovery and GTM strategy to competitive 
                        repositioning and risk mitigation, participants must deliver data-driven solutions where corporate 
                        survival hangs in the balance.

                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-top">
                        <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye"></i></div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="feature-title">Mark-O-Nova</div>
                            <div class="feature-subtitle">The Marketing Deception</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p>
                        Designed for marketers who understand that powerful brands are built through strategy and experience.
                        Participants were challenged to craft a go-to-market plan for Brewed Mysteries Café defining target 
                        audiences, shaping brand positioning, and designing immersive customer experiences for launch, where
                        bold ideas meet real-world execution.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

